{
    "title": "AI Mail Home",
    "description": "Get more done by transforming your home screen to an email powerhouse with AI Mail Home screen.\r\n\r\nAI Mail Launcher is a launcher app that transforms your Android home screen into an all-in-one, intuitive, AI-powered emailing engine.\r\n\r\nThanks to the powerful Launcher technology you can connect all of your Gmail, Outlook, and/or Yahoo email inboxes and easily access all your emails right on your home screen without switching between multiple mail apps.\r\n\r\nLet AI write emails for you so you can get more time in your day and improve your daily performance and productivity.\r\n\r\nCore Features:\r\n\r\nAI Mail Reply - No more thinking about how to write your emails. Just type or talk what you want to reply, hit \u201cReply with AI\u201d, and AI Mail will write an email for you.\r\n\r\nCombine your Gmail app, Outlook app, and Yahoo Mail app into one inbox. No more switching between your email apps.\r\n\r\nEmail cleanup: One-tap spam blocker! Block spam senders in seconds. Keep your inboxes clean, private, and secure with this simple email cleanup feature.\r\n\r\nConnect unlimited Gmail, Outlook, and Yahoo Mail accounts!\r\n\r\nCalendar invites illuminated in your mailbox: Never miss an important event from your Gmail, Outlook, or Yahoo Mail calendars.\r\n\r\nOne-Tap Account Switching: Easily switch between your mail accounts in our convenient mail app navigation bar.\r\n\r\nVoice-Enabled Mail Search: Find any mail with ease using the microphone on your keyboard in the inbox search bar.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd16 Get Back Your Time with AI Smart Send\r\n\r\nStop overthinking how to write your emails- let AI write them for you! Simply compose a new email or hit reply to one you\u2019re responding to and type or talk a few words of what you want to say and AI Mail will write the email for you. Our AI can rephrase it, elaborate, or shorten the email as you prefer. Use that extra time to crush it at work, learn some cool new stuff, or just kick back and enjoy some you-time.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce8 All-in-One Inbox\r\n\r\nView all your emails, from all your accounts, in one mail app. Eliminate the headache of overlooked emails and frustrating app-switching. Now, you can manage all your email accounts in one single place, conveniently a single swipe from your home screen.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udeab One-Tap Spam Blocker\r\n\r\nBlocking spam emails and specific senders has never been easier. Just tap on the \ud83d\udeab \u201cblock\u201d\ud83d\udeab button and you will never see an email from the sender in your primary inbox.\r\n\r\n \ud83d\udcc6Calendar Invites in Your Mailbox\r\n\r\nNever miss an important event. No need to frantically check your calendar app fearing to miss an invite- now you can see all your calendar invites highlighted straight in your email. Keep track of your appointments and special events right in your mail app.\r\n\r\nAndroid\u2122 is a trademark of Google LLC.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get more done by transforming your home screen to an email powerhouse with AI Mail Home screen.<br><br>AI Mail Launcher is a launcher app that transforms your Android home screen into an all-in-one, intuitive, AI-powered emailing engine.<br><br>Thanks to the powerful Launcher technology you can connect all of your Gmail, Outlook, and/or Yahoo email inboxes and easily access all your emails right on your home screen without switching between multiple mail apps.<br><br>Let AI write emails for you so you can get more time in your day and improve your daily performance and productivity.<br><br>Core Features:<br><br>AI Mail Reply - No more thinking about how to write your emails. Just type or talk what you want to reply, hit \u201cReply with AI\u201d, and AI Mail will write an email for you.<br><br>Combine your Gmail app, Outlook app, and Yahoo Mail app into one inbox. No more switching between your email apps.<br><br>Email cleanup: One-tap spam blocker! Block spam senders in seconds. Keep your inboxes clean, private, and secure with this simple email cleanup feature.<br><br>Connect unlimited Gmail, Outlook, and Yahoo Mail accounts!<br><br>Calendar invites illuminated in your mailbox: Never miss an important event from your Gmail, Outlook, or Yahoo Mail calendars.<br><br>One-Tap Account Switching: Easily switch between your mail accounts in our convenient mail app navigation bar.<br><br>Voice-Enabled Mail Search: Find any mail with ease using the microphone on your keyboard in the inbox search bar.<br><br>\ud83e\udd16 Get Back Your Time with AI Smart Send<br><br>Stop overthinking how to write your emails- let AI write them for you! Simply compose a new email or hit reply to one you\u2019re responding to and type or talk a few words of what you want to say and AI Mail will write the email for you. Our AI can rephrase it, elaborate, or shorten the email as you prefer. Use that extra time to crush it at work, learn some cool new stuff, or just kick back and enjoy some you-time.<br><br>\ud83d\udce8 All-in-One Inbox<br><br>View all your emails, from all your accounts, in one mail app. Eliminate the headache of overlooked emails and frustrating app-switching. Now, you can manage all your email accounts in one single place, conveniently a single swipe from your home screen.<br><br>\ud83d\udeab One-Tap Spam Blocker<br><br>Blocking spam emails and specific senders has never been easier. Just tap on the \ud83d\udeab \u201cblock\u201d\ud83d\udeab button and you will never see an email from the sender in your primary inbox.<br><br> \ud83d\udcc6Calendar Invites in Your Mailbox<br><br>Never miss an important event. No need to frantically check your calendar app fearing to miss an invite- now you can see all your calendar invites highlighted straight in your email. Keep track of your appointments and special events right in your mail app.<br><br>Android\u2122 is a trademark of Google LLC.",
